- No new commands: this module only replaces the prompt
- First line: current directory, then the git branch (or short commit hash when detached)
- `*` after the branch marks uncommitted changes to tracked files
{{ if eq .Options.style "full" -}}
- `user@host` is shown at the end of the first line (`style = "full"`)
{{ end -}}
{{ if and (eq .Shell "zsh") .Options.show_duration -}}
- Commands that ran for 1 second or longer show their duration in seconds after the directory and branch
{{ end -}}
{{ if and (eq .Shell "bash") .Options.show_duration -}}
- `show_duration` has no effect in bash
{{ end -}}
- Second line: the prompt character from the `char` option; a failed command shows its exit code in red before it
- Conflicts with the `starship` module: enable only one of them
